# Bifrost Schema

All tables are pre-declared `DomainTable` instances registered at boot. The physical schemas below are what DataFusion sees at scan time; they include system columns. The Rust record types in `wyrd-spec` (`SpanRecord`, `GenAiSpanRecord`, etc.) are the canonical source; this page documents the derived physical layout.

## Table namespaces

### Shared signal tables

**Namespace:** `vala.traces`, `vala.metrics`, `vala.logs`, `vala.genai`, `vala.eval`, `vala.drift`, `vala.dev`

**Partitioning:** `Day(event_time) + Bucket(tenant, 64)`

**Tenant isolation:** `data_tenant_id` column + bucket + `FilterExec` (via `TenantPredicateRule`)

All tenants write to the same physical Iceberg table. The `data_tenant_id` column + partitioning bucket enforce tenant isolation at scan time.

### Tenant-scoped dynamic datasets

**Namespace:** `vala.datasets.<tenant_uuid>.<name>`

**Partitioning:** `Day(event_time) + Bucket(tenant, 64)` (collapses to 1 slot for single-tenant tables)

**Tenant isolation:** Physical namespace + `data_tenant_id` + `FilterExec`

User-defined datasets for high-volume custom observability writes. Each tenant gets its own physical table namespace. Schema defined at Data Card registration.

## Common system columns (all tables)

| Column | Physical type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `data_tenant_id` | `Utf8` | Tenant isolation key (server-stamped) |
| `wyrd_event_time` | `Timestamp(µs, UTC)` | Canonical event time for partitioning and windowing |
| `wyrd_ingested_at` | `Timestamp(µs, UTC)` | Server-side flush wall clock |
| `wyrd_batch_id` | `FixedSizeBinary(16)` | Batch deduplication key |
| `run_id` | `Utf8` (nullable) | Correlation: job/experiment run |
| `card_uid` | `Utf8` (nullable) | Correlation: owning Card |
| `principal_id` | `Utf8` (nullable) | Correlation: emitting principal |

## vala.traces.spans

Source type: `SpanRecord` (`wyrd-spec::vala::traces`).

| Column | Physical type | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| `trace_id` | `FixedSizeBinary(16)` | 128-bit trace ID |
| `span_id` | `FixedSizeBinary(8)` | 64-bit span ID |
| `parent_span_id` | `FixedSizeBinary(8)` nullable | Absent for root span |
| `flags` | `UInt32` | OpenTelemetry span flags |
| `name` | `Utf8` | Span operation name |
| `kind` | `Utf8` | `SERVER`, `CLIENT`, `INTERNAL`, etc. |
| `start_time` | `Timestamp(µs, UTC)` | Span start |
| `end_time` | `Timestamp(µs, UTC)` | Span end |
| `duration_ms` | `UInt64` | `(end_time - start_time) / 1000` |
| `status` | `Utf8` | `OK`, `ERROR`, `UNSET` |
| `attributes` | `Utf8View` nullable | JSON-serialized span attributes, **payload-gated** |
| `service_name` | `Utf8` | Emitting service |
| + system columns | | |

